---
description: Where a new source file goes in src
globs: src/**
alwaysApply: false
---

`src/` is grouped by role. A new file goes in the folder that matches it. Do not add source files to the top of `src/`.

- `components/` — building blocks: buttons, inputs, swatches, sliders, menu items, FloatingPanel, icon helpers, and their trial previews.
- `toolbars/` — composites built from the blocks: toolbars, menus, and their placement logic.
- `canvas/` — what lives on the board: nodes, noodles, ports, selection and group chrome, guides, the marquee.
- `hooks/` — reusable React behavior, named `useSomething`.
- `lib/` — logic and data with no visuals: geometry, routing, files, text handling, `layers.ts`.

`App.tsx`, `main.tsx`, `index.css`, the `.d.ts` files, `assets/`, and `styles/` stay at the top.
